## 📌 About The Project

This project is an educational React practice project focused on building a simple Tic-Tac-Toe game.

Two players take turns playing on a 3x3 board. The game keeps track of player moves, switches turns automatically, and detects the winner based on the winning combinations.

---

## ✨ Features

- Two-player gameplay
- Automatic player turn switching
- Move history
- Winner detection
- Simple and clean UI

